         <section aria-label="NPC Latest News" class="news columns">
            <div class="wrapper">
               <div class="headBox">
                  <h2>Get <span class="highlight">Involved</span></h2><a href="/news" class="readMore desktopOnly">See All Latest News</a></div><div class="two"><div class="cell"><div class="article"><img loading="lazy" alt="National Park College" src="/_images/npc-800-square.jpg"><span class="date">September 24, 2026</span><a class="newsTitle" href="/news/2026/press-release/sept-bot.aspx"><h3>National Park College Reports Strong Overall Enrollment Growth for Fall 2026</h3></a><div class="wysiwygContent"><p>National Park College (NPC) has announced encouraging Fall 2026 enrollment results, highlighted by record-breaking concurrent enrollment as well as growth in first-time and transfer students.</p></div><a href="/news/2026/press-release/sept-bot.aspx" class="readMore" title="Read More About National Park College Reports Strong Overall Enrollment Growth for Fall 2026">Read More</a></div></div><div class="cell"><div class="article"><img loading="lazy" alt="National Park College" src="/_images/npc-800-square.jpg"><span class="date">October 28, 2026</span><a class="newsTitle" href="/news/2026/press-release/merger-authorized.aspx"><h3>NPC Board of Trustees Authorizes Merger with University of Arkansas System</h3></a><div class="wysiwygContent"><p>The National Park College (NPC) Board of Trustees approved a resolution at their regular Board Meeting on October 28 that authorizes the College to enter into a merger agreement with the University of Arkansas System.

The merger proposal will now advance to the University of Arkansas Board of Trustees for review and consideration.  If approved, NPC would become the 10th community college in Arkansas to join the University of Arkansas System.</p></div><a href="/news/2026/press-release/merger-authorized.aspx" class="readMore" title="Read More About NPC Board of Trustees Authorizes Merger with University of Arkansas System">Read More</a></div><div class="article"><img loading="lazy" alt="A group of people cutting a red ribbon in front of a building." src="/news/2026/images/metalworks.jpg"><span class="date">September 23, 2026</span><a class="newsTitle" href="/news/2026/press-release/metalworks.aspx"><h3>National Park College Celebrates Grand Opening of New Metalworks Facility</h3></a><div class="wysiwygContent"><p>National Park College (NPC) celebrated the grand opening of its new NPC Metalworks facility ahead of the College’s September Board of Trustees meeting Wednesday, marking a significant expansion of the College’s welding training capabilities.</p></div><a href="/news/2026/press-release/metalworks.aspx" class="readMore" title="Read More About National Park College Celebrates Grand Opening of New Metalworks Facility">Read More</a></div></div></div><a class="readMore mobileOnlyInline centered" href="/news">See All Latest News</a></div>
         </section>
          
         
         
         	
